title: The host puts a second folder on the canvas and takes the first one off: the guest gets one and loses the other
folders: share-text
fixtures: share-second
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: share: share-second is shared, 2 files
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-second

wait 3000
share start
wait 9000
workspace put {FIX}\share-second
wait 8000
mark host-two-folders
wait 600
workspace off {FIX}\share-text
wait 6000
mark host-one-folder
wait 5000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 9500
fit
wait 2000
mark two-folders
wait 6500
fit
wait 1500
mark one-folder
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
